    crm:P67i_is_referred_to_by [ a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "a point: a tagged lace or cord of twisted yarn, silk, thread or leather, used for attaching the hose to the doublet, lacing a bodice and fastening various parts of clothing (OED s.v. point n.1 II.5; MED s.v. lasinge 3). Includes the lacing point (lasyng/lacyng poynt)." ;
